{"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Case","symbolKind":"case","modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"graceNoteCue","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"fullNote","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLFullNote","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL11MXLFullNoteV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"grace","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLGrace","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL8MXLGraceV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"title":"MXLNote.Content.graceNoteCue(fullNote:grace:)","externalID":"s:7IvorMXL7MXLNoteV7ContentO12graceNoteCueyAeA07MXLFullF0V_AA8MXLGraceVtcAEmF","role":"symbol"},"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlnote\/content-swift.enum\/gracenotecue(fullnote:grace:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"graceNoteCue","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"fullNote","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLFullNote","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLFullNote","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL11MXLFullNoteV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"grace","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLGrace","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLGrace","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL8MXLGraceV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}]}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLNote\/Content-swift.enum\/graceNoteCue(fullNote:grace:)"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLNote","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLNote\/Content-swift.enum"]]},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A grace note that is also cue-sized\/silent-for-playback. Like all grace notes, it has no duration."}],"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLNote":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLNote"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Notes are the most common type of MusicXML data. The MusicXML format distinguishes between elements used for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sound information and elements used for notation information (e.g., tie is used for sound, tied for notation).","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Thus grace notes do not have a duration element. Cue notes have a duration element, as do forward elements,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"but no tie elements. Having these two types of information available can make interchange easier, as some","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"programs handle one type of information more readily than the other.","type":"text"}],"title":"MXLNote","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLNote","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlnote","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLNote"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLGrace":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLGrace"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The grace type indicates the presence of a grace note. The slash attribute for a grace note is yes for slashed","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"grace notes. The steal-time-previous attribute indicates the percentage of time to steal from the previous","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"note for the grace note. The steal-time-following attribute indicates the percentage of time to steal from the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"following note for the grace note, as for appoggiaturas. The make-time attribute indicates to make time, not","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"steal time; the units are in real-time divisions for the grace note.","type":"text"}],"title":"MXLGrace","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLGrace","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlgrace","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLGrace"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLFullNote":{"abstract":[{"text":"The full-note group is a sequence of the common note elements between cue\/grace notes and regular (full)","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"notes: pitch, chord, and rest information, but not duration (cue and grace notes do not have duration","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"encoded). Unpitched elements are used for unpitched percussion, speaking voice, and other musical elements","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"lacking determinate pitch.","type":"text"}],"title":"MXLFullNote","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLFullNote"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLFullNote"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlfullnote","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLFullNote"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLNote/Content-swift.enum":{"abstract":[{"text":"One of the alternatives for Note.","type":"text"}],"title":"MXLNote.Content","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Content"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Content"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlnote\/content-swift.enum","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLNote\/Content-swift.enum"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter."}],"title":"IvorMXL","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl","type":"topic","role":"collection"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLNote/Content-swift.enum/graceNoteCue(fullNote:grace:)":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A grace note that is also cue-sized\/silent-for-playback. Like all grace notes, it has no duration."}],"title":"MXLNote.Content.graceNoteCue(fullNote:grace:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLNote\/Content-swift.enum\/graceNoteCue(fullNote:grace:)","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlnote\/content-swift.enum\/gracenotecue(fullnote:grace:)","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"graceNoteCue"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"fullNote"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MXLFullNote","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL11MXLFullNoteV"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"grace"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MXLGrace","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL8MXLGraceV"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"role":"symbol"}}}